  "title": "iEEG_Neural_spatial_volatility",
  "description": "This dataset contains intracranial EEG (iEEG) recordings collected from patients undergoing clinical evaluation, used to investigate the spatial volatility of neural activity across brain regions. The data are shared to support research into cortical dynamics and epilepsy-related networks, and were collected under ethical approval from Wayne State University and Tohoku University institutional review boards.",
